{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §5.6, [TSON-SCHEMA] §7.2, [TSON-SCHEMA] §8.3 (values by name, proposed as §5.12)"
  description: "A qualified name is an entry, then a key of the namespace value it holds: orders resolves through the import to a namespace entry, a value of interface, and place_order is a key of it, whose value type is method -- the slot's own type. Every hop is written; nothing is looked up lexically."
  valid: {
    binds: [routes orders]
  }
